    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d293">

                <pb facs="0271" n="259" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg259"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.20/174a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-10-28T19:00:00-04:00">October 28, 1942—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>295. In connection with the drafting of an Agreement for a United States Military
                    Mission to Iran consisting of Colonel Schwarzkopf, Lieutenant Colonel Boone and
                    Captain Preston, the following information is urgently desired: <list>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>.</label>
                        <item>What in your opinion should be the stated purpose of the
                            Mission?</item>
                        <pb facs="0272" n="260" xml:id="pg260"/>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>.</label>
                        <item>To what official of the Iranian Government will the Mission be
                            responsible?</item>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.</label>
                        <item>Approximate duration of the Mission?</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <p>Please discuss the above points with Colonel Schwarzkopf replying by telegram and
                    furnishing any other information which in your opinion would be helpful to the
                    Department in drafting this Agreement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
